<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6342] Exchange is hanging on eviction</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6342</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I wrote test which stop/start random node, the test hangs time to time on exchange.&lt;br/&gt;
As I see, exchange-thread waiting for partition eviction.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13101292">IGNITE-6342</key>
            <summary>Exchange is hanging on eviction</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
